marie: keep PAN unchanged on exception entry when built without PAN

SPAN is RES1 on the ARMv8.0 A73, so the phone is unaffected. QEMU's
cortex-a76 has PAN: with SPAN=0 every exception set PSTATE.PAN and the
kernel, which never clears it, faulted forever in copyout (16.5M data
aborts at bcopyout in skmem init).

